  "scope": "Held U10-02 prompt-only Q2_0 16-row expert dispatch over the P07-capable small-stack engine. Retains original 16x64 Tensor API product, 128 threads, K order, scaling, barriers, 8192-byte scratch and route map. Splits the original two-half 32-row tile into separate 16-row dispatches and omits unused upper input loads. Tensor API and bounded original compact geometry predicate required; compact worklists excluded; fewer than 32 and more than 512 tokens fall back. Inherited W02/P11 flags remain disabled. No decode TPS or exact-output claim until qualification.",
